    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
